---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import brandBrainBee from '../../../asset/individual-bees/06-brand-second-brain-no-name.png';
---
<Layout>
<div class="growth-page">
<section class="growth-page-hero shell"><p class="eyebrow-accent">SOFTWARE & DIGITAL PRODUCTS</p><h1>AI workflow products.<br /><em>Tools for repeatable work.</em></h1><p class="growth-lead">For operators who would rather run it themselves. Eight free calculators are live today — no signup, no email. The recurring-AI product is still in development, and we say exactly what is decided and what is not.</p></section>
<section class="section-space shell growth-split"><div><span class="growth-status">IN DEVELOPMENT</span><h2 class="section-title">mlabs Skill Manager</h2><p>One place to organise AI skills, schedule recurring tasks, and review what they produce. Built around the work you need to repeat, from audits to content workflows.</p><a class="growth-button" href="/products/skill-manager">Explore the product ↗</a><p class="growth-note">Not yet for sale. Pricing and release details are pending.</p></div><figure class="growth-diagram"><img src={brandBrainBee.src} width="640" height="640" loading="lazy" alt="Three stages in a Skill Manager routine: organise context, schedule a task, review its output." /><figcaption>Product concept · workflow illustration, not a live app screenshot</figcaption></figure></section>
<section class="section-space growth-evidence"><div class="shell growth-split"><article><p class="eyebrow-accent">AVAILABLE NOW · FREE</p><h2 class="section-title">Put a number<br />on the problem.</h2><p>Eight calculators for marketplace and website profit, order economics, return-to-origin costs, inventory, bundles, marketing budgets and cash runway. No login, no email, nothing leaves your browser. Change the inputs and compare scenarios in a minute.</p><a class="text-link" href="/tools">Use the free calculators ↗</a></article><article><p class="eyebrow-accent">PLANNED · DIGITAL PRODUCTS</p><h2 class="section-title">A useful outcome.<br />With instructions.</h2><p>We’re developing practical workflow products with examples and setup guidance. The first paid product and its release details have not been announced.</p><p>There is no paid download or bundle available here yet. Each release will explain what’s included, what you need, and where to get help.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="section-space shell growth-callout"><div><h2>Need it built for your brand?</h2><p>Services are a separate path. We scope it, build it with your team, and hand it over in your accounts.</p></div><a class="growth-button" href="/services#services">See what we fix ↗</a></section>
</div></Layout>
